  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "ir-01",
      "severity": "major",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Changed Skill contents retained previously published version identities. The implementer incremented all six patch versions and updated the worktree Skill date; together with register/protocol, all eight changed Skill directories now have new versions. Inspected all eight baseline/candidate versions and built an actual temporary embedded-fullstack bundle with the optional flaky Skill. All eight new paths and entrypoint bytes matched the candidate, and the transport reference was packaged."
    },
    {
      "id": "ir-02",
      "severity": "minor",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Protocol compression omitted the explicit independent per-layer state-machine requirement. The implementer restored '各层独立 timeout/状态机，参数依据协议/链路/产品预算' while retaining the overall monotonic deadline and remaining-budget rules. Read the restored sentence in canonical source; verified the final consumer reread and answer explicitly preserve the same requirement."
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "PR checks, protected merge, fresh-main verification, immutable tag and final Release artifacts remain outside this review's observed evidence.",
    "Host regression does not certify external agent hosts, native model/runtime behavior, ARM/MCU, real links, HIL or field behavior.",
    "Git flags do not sandbox other content filters or untrusted repositories; binary/gitlink contents and untracked bodies still need scoped review.",
    "Transport execution did not cover the complete matrix: partial/no-progress writes, length overflow, backpressure, residual-frame EOF, cancellation or reconnect isolation in a real project implementation remain unmeasured.",
    "C arithmetic tests do not execute SVD inheritance, real reset selection or safe MMIO. Mask-zero/undefined/unknown semantics were also checked through source and consumer reasoning.",
    "Condition.wait_for does not establish hard bounds on lock acquisition or scheduling, or a complete application cancellation/cleanup protocol; producer same-lock discipline and real timing tests remain required.",
    "Mapped path is not executed dispatch. Production kernel/ISA/precision/thread/model-path identity, performance gain and thermal causality remain unproven.",
    "The one consumer session with three scenarios and a same-session reread has no blinded control, randomization or independent repeats. Model, token, latency and cost effects remain not-measured.",
    "Only the current preregistration transition is verified. Older inherited unexecuted-candidate history is not claimed exhaustive; results remain empty and the author-exposed holdout remains unqualified.",
    "The historical CTest timeout cause remains unknown; later green runs do not prove repair.",
    "The reviewer checked recorded external identities, decisions, scope and license evidence levels without independently refetching every external file or performing a legal-license audit. No external pack/script was imported/executed.",
    "Source-byte/profile results are not measured runtime-context, token, cost or general task-success improvements."
  ],
